\pard\fi0\li0\tx4758\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Literatur: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 lban\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 old\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Colligere Fragmenta, ne pereant! (Fragen zu einem fragmentarischen Neufund), in: Scriptorium 4 (1950) S. 92-96. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 rnold\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 argarete\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  P\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 fister\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 -B\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 urkhalter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Notiz zu P. Alban Dold \u187 \'bbColligere fragmenta, ne pereant\u171 \'ab, in: Scriptorium 5 (1951) S. 103f. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 lban\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 old\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 laus\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 amber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Sakramentar von Salzburg (Texte und Arbeiten, 4. Beiheft) Beuron 1960, S. 5f. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 laus\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs16 amber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Codices liturgici Latini antiquiores, Freiburg/Schweiz \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1968, S. 402 Nr. 886. - Kat. 2,2,1, 1975, S. 89.}

