3\fs22 . 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). Schriftraum: 13,5-15x9-9,5 cm (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ); 16,5-18x12,5 cm (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). 2 Spalten. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 47-51 Zeilen; 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 -190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 41-45 Zeilen; 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 - 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : 51-58 Zeilen. Gotica von vielen verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden.
