\pard\fi0\li0\tx4157\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Literatur: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 A\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 dolfo\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  V\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 enturi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Storia dell\rquote arte italiana 3: L\rquote arte romanica, Mailand 1904, S. 458-460 mit Abb. 428-430. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 P\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 aolo\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 \rquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 A\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 ncona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , La miniature italienne du X\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  au XVI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  si\u232 \'e8cle, Paris-Br\u252 \'fcssel 1925, S. 14. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 A\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 dalbert\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 raf\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 zu\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  E\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 rbach\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 -F\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 rstenau\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Vortrag \u252 \'fcber Bolognesische Vulgaten, 1932 (Masch. Schr.; Stuttgart, WLB, 24a/2167). - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 C\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 arl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  N\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 ordenfalk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Insulare und kontinentale Psalterillustrationen aus dem 13. Jahrhundert, in: Acta archaeologica 10 (1939) S. 107-120, bes. S. 114. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 A\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 ngela\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 aneu\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  L\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 attanzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Ancora sulla scuola miniaturistica dell\rquote Italia meridionale Sveva, in: La Bibliofil\u237 \'eda 66 (1964) S. 105-162, bes. S. 150-155. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Z\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 ahlten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Sch\u246 \'f6pfungsdarstellungen, 1975, S. 234 Nr. 6. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 ers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ., Creatio mundi, 1979, S. 63, 137, 275 Nr. 570. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 arie\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 -T\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 h\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 \u232 \'e8\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 se\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 ousset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Un t\u233 \'e9moignage in\u233 \'e9dit de l\rquote enluminure bolonaise du XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  si\u232 \'e8cle, in: Revue de l\rquote art 57 (1982) S. 53-55 mit Anm. 7. - Mss. enlumin\u233 \'e9s d\rquote origine italienne 2, 1984, S. 77f. mit Anm. 7. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 L\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 uisa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 orozzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Art. \u187 \'bbBologna, Miniatura\u171 \'ab, in: Enciclopedia dell\rquote arte medievale 3, Rom 1992, S. 597-604, bes. S. 599. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 ichael\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22  B. N\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs18 orris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , Early gothic illuminated Bibles at Bologna: The \u187 \'bbprima maniera\u171 \'ab phase, 1250-1274, Diss. phil. University of California 1993, S. 252 Nr. 32, 262, 276 und bes. S. 361-489, 829-835.
