\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Diverse kurze Texte und Exzerpte. (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aurelius Augustinus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De trinitate}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Lib. IV Prooemium \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scientiam terrestrium celestiarumque rerum magni estimare solet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et conditoris eius beati dei sui.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 42, Sp. 885\~ff. (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pseudo-Bernardus Claraevallensis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in verba evangelii \u187 \'bbEcce nos reliquimus omnia\u171 \'ab}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In illo tempore dixit Symon petrus ad iesum Ecce nos reliquimus omnia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mt 19,27) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verae conuersationis <!> exemplum nobis hic proponitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 paupertate conseruatur, munditia decoratur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schlu\u223 \'dfsatz fehlt. PL 184, Sp. 1127\endash 1132. (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus <Claraevallensis>}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de diversis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  LXIV\endash LXV. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pretiosa in conspectu dei mors sanctorum eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 115,15) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tria sunt quae sanctum hominem faciunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quicquid molestum est foras mittetur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 183, Sp.\~687A\endash 688A. (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 <Claraevallensis>}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In assumptione B. V. Mariae sermo III}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quibus enim nulla credita est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aqua conpunctionis ingnita \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 sic\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diaboli iacula constringentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korrigiert zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 restringentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). PL 183. Sp.\~423C\endash 424\u176 \'b0. (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus <Claraevallensis>}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de lectione libri sapientiae \u187 \'bbHi sunt viri misericordiae\u171 \'ab}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 erito fratres apostolis sanctis atribuit mater ecclesia quod in sapientiae libris legitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hereditatem semen christi et apostolorum nepotes.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 183, Sp. 412\endash 416. (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus <Claraevallensis>}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones in cantica canticorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Sermo XXIX 4\endash 5. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dilectissimi pacem habete ad uos et nolite ledere inuicem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Turbatus sum et non sum locutus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 183, Sp. 930\~f. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dialogi}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  III\~20. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Petrus. Laboriosum ualde est atque terribile contra inimici insidias semper intendere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uirtutes terreatur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 77, Sp.\~272. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sumamus igitur coronam spineam id est festinemus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~exterior per magnitudinem et interior per subtilitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eadmer Cantuariensis}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[7].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber de S. Anselmi similitudinibus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Cap. CXLVII\endash CLI. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anselmus. Detractionis uitium maxime ex otiositate solet nasci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anime uictum auferre quam corporis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 159, Sp. 689\~ff. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Cantor}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[8].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verbum abbreviatum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Cap. 73. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aliquis uir bonus nobis eligendus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Seneca, ep. 11) \u8230 \'85\~\endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nisi ad regulam praua non corriges.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 205, Sp. 237. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hugo de S. Victore}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[9].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De meditando seu meditandi artificio opusculum aureum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod enim a diabolo suggeritur, sicut alienum est ab homine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 donec posterius tempore suo apprehendat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abgedruckt in PL 176, Sp. 996\~ff. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Job}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . XVI. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gregorius in moralia. Ille uero perfectus qui ad imperfectionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 necdum profecit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 75, Sp. 697. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cyprianus <Carthaginensis>}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[11].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber de mortalitate}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid non properamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 incolumitate soliciti.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 4, Sp.\~624A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Biblia, AT. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[12].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iob}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 33,14\endash 15. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si direxerit ad deum cor suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cineri reuertetur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pseudo-Bonaventura: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[13].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pharetra}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  IV\~25. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mens in qua anima per amorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in uulnere amoris.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[14].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De vili vestitu ecclesiasticorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Cap. 1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Petrus Damiani. Uis uidere uarietatem uestium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 immarcescibiliter vernat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 145, Sp. 518D\endash 519A. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[15].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De brevitate vitae pontificum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Cap. 5. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pulcrum ergo mundanam condictionem homo considerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ueraciter sit sublimis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 145, Sp. 480B\endash C. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[8].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[16].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentaria in quatuor libros sententiarum magistri Petri Lombardi}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Lib. II dist. XVI art. 1 quaest. 1 conclusio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus enim uniuersa propter semetipsum operatus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 16,4)\~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia in hoc assimilatur ei expresse.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Bonaventura: Opera omnia, hg. v. PP. Collegii a S. Bonaventura, Bd. 2, Quaracchi 1885, S.\~394\~f. (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Job}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . LXIX. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nil quippe sic ad edomandum desideriorum carnalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad fetorem putredinis hanelat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 sic\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . PL 75, Sp. 1162. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Job}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 XII\~12. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Constituisti terminos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Temporaliter uiuat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 75, Sp. 986D. IX\~53. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vitam nobis et misericordiam tribuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 studio innouata uidebatur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 75, Sp.\~903A. IX\~55. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Districtoque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tergat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 75, Sp.\~904B. IX\~55. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dignum est ut qui immunda cogitatione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  arbitretur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 75, Sp.\~904C. IX\~62. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dimitte me ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 timore praeuidetur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 75, Sp.\~911B\endash C. (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[9].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Cassianus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[17].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collationes}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  XXIII\~21. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abbas Theonas. Nec tamen ex eo debemus nos a dei communione suspendere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aut otiosa oblivione depereunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 49, Sp. 1278\~ff. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Damiani}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[15].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De brevitate vitae pontificum}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  romanum et divina providentia.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  IV. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum deus homini tantam praeroget gratiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 illius obscena dinumerans profitetur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 145, Sp. 478. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[9].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Cassianus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[17].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collationes}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  X\~10. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui enim jugiter suum invocat protectorem certus est eum esse semper praesentem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 49, Sp. 833.}

