\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Cassianus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collationes}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Exzerpte. (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XII, 7, 3\endash 4. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gradus precelse castitatis. Primus itaque pudicitie gradus est ne uigilans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adhuc medullitus latitantis indicium est.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~345\~f. XIV, 6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Solent enim hii qui necdum sunt in illa quam arripuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in qualibet professione perfectus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~402. XXIII,\~19. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nam quantauis circumspectione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 superesse quo tendit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~669. (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XXII, 14\endash 15. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abbas theone. Nam cum apostolus paulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 illa die iustus iudex.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~634\~f. (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XXIII,\~13\endash 14. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia ergo carnales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 execrantur exercere compellens.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~CSEL 13, S.\~658\~ff. (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XIX, 12. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannes. In ueritate querentibus medicinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cordis archana non possunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~545\~ff. (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XXIV,\~5. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nec mirum si in cella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 consequatur afflictio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL\~13, S.\~679. (343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XVI, 6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod amicitia non nisi inter perfectos possit seruari. Primum igitur sunt uere amicitie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec pati potuit nec inferre. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 CSEL 13, S.\~442\~f. XVI, 6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nihil enim proderit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alium quempiam perdat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~444\~f. XVI, 18. (343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Illud uero quale est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 subdola blandimenta.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~452\~ff. (343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XII,\~6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cheremon. Quantum enim quis in leuitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 suberbie tumore substollitur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~341\~ff. (344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) V,\~2\endash 3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abbas Sarapion. Octo sunt principalia uitia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 accidia atque tristitia.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~121\~f. (344\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) XX, 9\endash 10. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Impossibile namque est mentem bonis cogitationibus immorari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uel cenum eius uoluerit commouere.\~\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 CSEL 13, S. 567. XIV, 13, 2\endash 5. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vacare enim cunctis cogitationibus humana mens non potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 amara dulcia uidentur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CSEL 13, S.\~414\~f. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Damascenus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De fide orthodoxa}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  IV\~13. Burgundionis versio, cap. 86,\~9.  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui comedit me uiuit propter me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (cf. Io 6,58).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ideo cum omni timore et conscientia pura et inesitabili fide\~\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et illuminet corda nostra et participatione diuini ignis igniamur et deificemur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 John Damascene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : De fide orthodoxa. Versions of Burgundio and Cerbanus, hg. v. E.\~M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Buytaert,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  St. Bonaventure/Louvain/Paderborn 1955 (Franciscan Institute Publications. Text Series 8), S.\~314.}

