\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 345\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Legenda maior sancti Francisci}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prologus, Capitula (nur bis zum 4. Kap.). \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pparuit gratia dei saluatoris nostri diebus istis nouissimis in seruo suo francisco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quarto de profectu ordinis sub manu ipsius et confirmatione.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ausgabe. S. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bonaventura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Opera omnia, ed. studi et cura PP. Collegii a S. Bonaventura, Bd. 8, Quaracchi 1898, S.\~504\~f.}

