\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 346\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Jacopone da Todi}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lauda}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vn arbore da deo plantato lo quale amore es nomenato}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 / ho tu homo ke \u231 \'e7ai salito di in que forma tu \u231 \'e7ei gito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A la laude del segnore dicto to isto tenore se uol salire or pun lo core a tutto quell iaio parlato / A la laude de iesu christo si receuo lo tuo dicto uoglio te uiuire {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 lo ficto mentre io giro peregrinato}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ausgabe. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Iacopone da Todi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Laude, hg. v. F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mancini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bari/Roma 1974 (Scrittori d\rquote Italia 257), S.\~231\endash 236.}

