\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 371\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moralia in Iob}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Exzerpte. II 18. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sicut domino placuit ita factum est. Cum enim in hac uita ea que uolumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 passione murmuramus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CC Ser. lat. 143, S.\~79. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si patiens percussum suadat domini\~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~satisfacit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u9632 \'a6 V 11. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sepe ipsa nostra iustitia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fulget operantis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 CC Ser. lat. 143, S.\~232. V 34. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quamuis in corporea sit anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 postponens ei omnia.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CC Ser. lat. 143, S.\~262. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De gaudiis BMV}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gaude uirgo mater christi, que per aurem concepisti gabriele nuntio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Gaude quia deo plena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 Sechs mit vielen K\u252 \'fcrzungen geschriebene Strophen, davon die ersten vier in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH 42, S.\~82 (Nr.\~73}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Str. 1a, 2a, 5a, 6a, die letzten beiden Strophen nicht nachgewiesen. Im Anschlu\u223 \'df: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oratio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus qui beatissimam semper uirginem mariam in conceptu et partu uirginitate seruata}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \par}

