\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 375\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Isti sunt denarii quos expendi in breuiario mo. inprimis .c. solidi quos habui de tunica quam uendidi fratri iacobutum dd. iacobi. Item tres libra quas accomodauit mihi pater meus. Item .xl. solidi quos dimisit mihi domina altiphia. Item quattuor libra quas dederat mihi domine de sancto paulo pro tunica. Item .xl. solidi quos de tunica quam uendidi fratro benedicto de trebio. Item tres libra quas habui de tunica quam uendidi fratri angelico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (???) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ualfredicti. Item una laterna pro x et viii solidis. Item quatuor libra quas recepi de uno diurno. Item tres libra quas recepi de una tunica in loco montisfalci. Item una alia tunica quam recepi in loco meuanee \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Bevagna (Umbrien)\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85 habui quatuor libra. Item una alia quam habui in monasterio \u231 \'e7i\u231 \'e7ani \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ceccano (Latium)?\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro qua recepi quatuor libra.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset2 Symbol;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 375\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitere {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exzerpte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Der Text ist so verblasst und abgerieben, dass er weitestgehend unleserlich ist.
