\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa63\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Diverse {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gebet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 s- und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 liturgische Texte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Istam intentionem semper dic ante celebrationem Missae summa cum deuotione.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Darunter (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dies irae.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dies irae, dies illa solvet\~\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 AH 54, Nr. 178}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Carmen de laudibus b. virginis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Haec est stella maris, vitae via\~\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Chevalier}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  27525}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u225 \'e1{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Comestor}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : De excellentia Mariae.\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \u241 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si fieri posset quod arenae pulvis\~\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Walther}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Initia 17728}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Litaniae pro Germania saepe a Germanis recitandae.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
