\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Widmungsbrief}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anthony Stafford}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  an Lady Elisabeth Berkeley, Tochter des George Carew, Baron of Hunsdon, London 6. April 1628. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Widmungsgedicht}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (44 V.) des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anthony Stafford}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Madam I would but praise, not flatter; yet / what flatters others does your praise but fitt ...-... By writing but of you, the world shall see / I am the first, drew truth to poetrie. Anthony Stafford\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Allianzwappen s.o.}

